# Normalize line endings: this repo ships shell scripts that are executed by
# bash on Windows (Git Bash). A git-clone-based installer on a machine with
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise smudge LF to CRLF on checkout, and every
# script dies with "$'\r': command not found". eol=lf overrides autocrlf for
# every path below, so checkouts are byte-identical on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.tsv text eol=lf
